    <h2>Room types, sizes and beds</h2>
    <p>Standard and Preferred rooms are the same layout. You are paying for location. Official listings describe views of the garden, courtyard, riverfront or parking area. Preferred rooms are listed as close to the lobby, dining, shopping and transportation.</p>
