  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Sassagoula Floatworks and Food Factory</strong> is the quick-service food court, and the main place for breakfast, lunch and dinner while the lounge and café are being refurbished.</li>
      <li><strong>Scat Cat's Club – Café</strong> closed for refurbishment beginning October 6, 2026, and is expected to reopen in December 2026. <strong>Scat Cat's Club – Lounge</strong> is expected to reopen in January 2027. Confirm both are open before you plan on them.</li>
      <li>Port Orleans Riverside, next door, has Boatwright's Dining Hall for table service.</li>
      <li>You can use mobile ordering in the My Disney Experience app at the quick-service spots.</li>
      <li><strong>Park dining reservations:</strong> Disney resort guests can book their whole stay (up to 10 nights) starting 60 days before arrival.</li>
    </ul>
    <span class="ryan">[Ryan: your go-to meal here, and one thing you'd skip.]</span>
