  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Doubloon Lagoon</strong> is the main pool. Official pages describe a 51-foot sea-serpent slide (Scales), a water play area for guests 48 inches or under, a whirlpool spa and the Mardi Grogs pool bar.</li>
      <li>Official pool pages also say French Quarter guests can use <strong>Ol' Man Island</strong> at Port Orleans Riverside, a short walk or boat ride down the river, with a 95-foot slide, a whirlpool spa and a kiddie pool.</li>
      <li>Towels are free at the pools. Hours and lifeguard coverage vary and can change.</li>
    </ul>
