  <section id="booking">
    <h2>Booking and value tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Book a Standard Location room if you don't mind a short walk.</strong> In 2026 those rooms ran about $322 to $483 a night at full price including tax, depending on dates. Preferred Location rooms ran about $356 to $557. King rooms ran about $375 to $578.</li>
      <li><strong>Pay for Preferred if you want to be closer to the lobby, the food court and the boat dock.</strong> The room is the same layout.</li>
      <li><strong>Need a child-size pull-down bed or a Royal Guest Room?</strong> Those categories are at Riverside, not here.</li>
      <li><strong>Extra adults cost more.</strong> Moderate rates assume two adults. Each extra adult adds $25 a night plus tax, and kids under 18 are free.</li>
      <li><strong>Check Disney's own offers page first.</strong> Disney points to <a href="https://disneyworld.disney.go.com/special-offers/">its special offers page</a> for discounts. Our deals hub will track current ones.</li>
      <li><strong>Lightning Lane head start:</strong> Disney resort guests can buy Lightning Lane passes up to 7 days before their stay.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="fg-callout">
